{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]In the [C]temple late at night
The lamp of [F]God was burning [C]bright
Lit[F]tle Samuel lay [C]down
Then he [G]heard a calling sound
[C]Samuel, [G/B]Samuel
He [Am]jumped up and ran to [C/G]Eli
[F]Here I am; [C/E]you called me
[G]I did not call. Go back and lie [C]down
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Speak, LORD, [Em]for your [F]servant is [G]listening
