[C]Ears wide open, [G/B]sitting still
[F]Tell me, LORD, [G]and I [C]will [F]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Once a[C]gain the voice [G/B]came near
Samuel, [Am]Samuel, can you [C/G]hear
